config ZLRS_CONFIG
	bool "Config protocol (framing and dispatch on the config CDC)"
	select ZLRS_PROTO
	help
	  Framing and command dispatch for the config CDC while the device is in config mode
	  (entries: docs/design/08-firmware.md 2, command table: docs/design/10-security.md 10).
	  Pure C: commands only touch the device through backend callbacks, so the host tests
	  can run every one of them against a fake backend, see tests/host.

module = ZLRS_CONFIG
module-str = zlrs_config
source "subsys/logging/Kconfig.template.log_config"
